cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KubeSentient (Autonomous SRE Agent) in research or production, please cite it as below."
title: "KubeSentient: Autonomous SRE Agent for Kubernetes Alert Triage"
abstract: >-
  An autonomous site reliability agent that ingests Prometheus AlertManager
  webhooks, investigates the affected Kubernetes resources via read-only
  tools, retrieves runbook context from a Weaviate RAG store, and produces
  a structured remediation plan via a LangGraph workflow exposed through
  a FastAPI service.
